{
  "_doc": "Seed list of disc molds: only molds known to exist (a documented gap beats a wrong entry). No flight numbers. 'type' is one of Distance Driver, Fairway Driver, Midrange, Putter, Approach, or an empty string when the mold is certain but its speed class is not. 'aliases' are extra spellings; spacing and punctuation differences (Roc 3 / Roc3 / Tee Bird) never need an alias. Same mold name under two manufacturers is allowed and resolved from vendor, brand and plastic. Added for eBay (parser version 3), each one a mold I am sure exists: 11 Innova (Daedalus, Xcaliber, Aero, Gazelle, Charger, Cheetah, Skeeter, Orc, Ape, Whale, Nova), 5 Discraft (Cicada, Passion, Crush, Hades, Sol), 5 Dynamic Discs (Freedom, Rebel, Justice, Hunter, Lieutenant); speed classes are left empty where not certain. Known gaps: the long tail of out-of-production molds (eBay sells many), Roc+ / Roc Plus (listed titles with a glued plus stay review), most MVP/Axiom/Streamline molds, and every maker without molds yet. A real mold missing here is never matched to a neighbour: it comes out as review with the title's word as the mold guess.",
